  "listing": {
    "section": "demo",
    "blurb": "A beam of pure white light strikes a spinning crystal prism, casting sweeping refractive spectrum fans and specular caustics into the void.",
    "prompt": "A beam of white light enters a slowly rotating glass prism and fans into a full spectrum across the dark, the rainbow sweeping as the prism turns, faint internal reflections glinting. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
